 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Tool Manipulation — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You can control tools you imbue with cursed energy.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st level, you can spend CE up to your CE modifier as a bonus action to imbue a tool you are holding with cursed energy. This imbuement lasts an hour for each cursed energy spent and gains the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You gain a +2 bonus to attack rolls using this tool or a +1 bonus to AC if the tool is armor or used defensively  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The damage die increases by 1 tier and again at 6th and 11th level (D4&lt;D6&lt;D8&lt;D10&lt;2d6&lt;2d8)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
